  "notes": "Saudia Dairy and Foodstuff Company (SADAFCO; ticker 2270) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/407_0_2026-02-17...). Auditor: PricewaterhouseCoopers. The consolidated financial statements were approved and authorised for issue by the Board of Directors on 11 February 2026 (Note 38). Amounts are presented in thousands of Saudi Riyals (scale 1000). The primary statements are digital text in the filed PDF (transcribed directly). Consolidated group; equity has no non-controlling interest at either year-end (the small FY2024 NCI was extinguished on the disposal of a subsidiary), so only total_equity is carried. IFRS 5: SADAFCO has a discontinued operation in both years (its overseas dairy operations - loss SAR 10,599 thousand FY2025 / SAR 9,633 thousand FY2024, Note 27), plus a small held-for-sale disposal group at FY2025 (assets SAR 30,342 thousand, liabilities SAR 6,590 thousand, both already inside the reported current subtotals). The reported 'Profit before zakat and income tax from continuing operations' (SAR 513,402 thousand FY2025) is a continuing-operations figure, so income_before_income_taxes_and_zakat is NOT carried; continuing_operations_income and discontinued_operations_income are carried and net_income = continuing + discontinued is checked. income_taxes_and_zakat is the 'Zakat and income tax expense' (continuing operations). impairment_charges is the 'Reversal of impairment on financial assets' line - a positive figure (a net reversal) in both years. other_income is 'Other operating income' (FY2025 includes a SAR 107,417 thousand gain on disposal of an asset held for sale). operating_income is the reported 'Operating profit'. long_term_investments is the non-current 'Financial assets at fair value through profit or loss'. treasury_shares is the 'Treasury shares reserve'; other_reserves is the 'Foreign currency translation reserve' (the statutory reserve and other reserve were transferred to retained earnings in FY2024 under the new Companies Law and are nil at both year-ends). related_party_payables is 'Due to related parties'; other_current_liabilities is 'Dividends payable'; zakat_payable is 'Accrued zakat and income tax'; accrued_expenses is 'Accrued expenses and other liabilities'. lease_liabilities_noncurrent / lease_liabilities_current are the non-current / current portions of lease liabilities (SADAFCO has no bank debt). defined_benefit_obligation is 'Employee benefit obligations'. depreciation_amortization sums 'Depreciation on property, plant and equipment', 'Depreciation on right-of-use assets' and 'Amortisation on intangible assets' from the cash-flow statement. capex is 'Payments for property, plant and equipment'; interest_paid is 'Finance costs paid'; zakat_paid is 'Zakat and income tax paid'; dividends_paid is 'Dividends paid'. foreign_exchange_effect is the 'Effects of exchange rate fluctuations on cash and cash equivalents'. The cash-flow closing balance (SAR 468,719 thousand) is above the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line (SAR 464,231 thousand) because SAR 4,488 thousand of cash sits inside the held-for-sale disposal group, so the cash-to-balance-sheet cross-check warns (expected). Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: financial position 6, profit or loss 7, comprehensive income 8, changes in equity 9, cash flows 10-11.",
